{"slug":"/references/js_sdk/admin/Promotion/methods/js_sdk.admin.Promotion.addRules","title":"addRules","frontmatter":{},"toc":[{"title":"Example","id":"example","level":2},{"title":"Parameters","id":"addrules-parameters","level":2},{"title":"Returns","id":"addrules-returns","level":2}],"blocks":[{"kind":"markdown","html":"This method creates and adds rules to a promotion. It can be the promotion's rules,\nor its application method's buy or target rules. That depends on the rule type\nyou specify as a parameter.\n\n- If you set the `ruleType` to `rules`, the method sends a request to the\n[Manage Promotion's Rules API Route](https://docs.medusajs.com/api/admin#promotions\\_postpromotionsidrulesbatch).\n- If you set the `ruleType` to `buy-rules`, the method sends a request to the\n[Manage Promotion's Buy Rules API Route](https://docs.medusajs.com/api/admin#promotions\\_postpromotionsidbuyrulesbatch).\n- If you set the `ruleType` to `target-rules`, the method sends a request to the\n[Manage Promotion's Target Rules API Route](https://docs.medusajs.com/api/admin#promotions\\_postpromotionsidtargetrulesbatch)."},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"text":"Example","id":"example"},{"kind":"markdown","html":"```ts\nsdk.admin.promotion.addRules(\"promo_123\", \"rules\", {\n  rules: [\n    {\n      operator: \"eq\",\n      attribute: \"product_id\",\n      values: [\"prod_123\"]\n    }\n  ]\n})\n.then(({ promotion }) => {\n  console.log(promotion)\n})\n```"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"text":"Parameters","id":"addrules-parameters"},{"kind":"typeList","sectionTitle":"addRules","types":[{"name":"id","type":"`string`","description":"The promotion's ID.","optional":false,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[]},{"name":"ruleType","type":"`string`","description":"The type of rules to create.","optional":false,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[]},{"name":"payload","type":"[BatchAddPromotionRulesReq](/references/types/HttpTypes/interfaces/types.HttpTypes.BatchAddPromotionRulesReq)","description":"The rules to create.","optional":false,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[{"name":"rules","type":"[AdminCreatePromotionRule](/references/types/HttpTypes/interfaces/types.HttpTypes.AdminCreatePromotionRule)[]","description":"The rules to add.","optional":false,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[{"name":"operator","type":"[PromotionRuleOperatorValues](/references/promotion/types/promotion.PromotionRuleOperatorValues)","description":"The operator used to check whether the buy rule applies on a cart.\nFor example, `eq` means that the cart's value for the specified attribute\nmust match the specified value.","optional":false,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[]},{"name":"description","type":"`null` \\| `string`","description":"The description of the promotion rule.","optional":true,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[]},{"name":"attribute","type":"`string`","description":"The attribute to compare against when checking whether a promotion can be applied on a cart.","optional":false,"defaultValue":"","example":"items.product_id","expandable":false,"children":[]},{"name":"values","type":"`string` \\| `string`[]","description":"The value to compare against when checking whether a promotion can be applied on a cart.","optional":false,"defaultValue":"","example":"prod_123","expandable":false,"children":[]}]}]},{"name":"headers","type":"[ClientHeaders](/references/js_sdk/admin/types/js_sdk.admin.ClientHeaders)","description":"Headers to pass in the request.","optional":true,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[{"name":"tags","type":"`string`[]","description":"Tags to cache data under for Next.js applications.\n\nLearn more in [Next.js's documentation](https://nextjs.org/docs/app/building-your-application/caching#fetch-optionsnexttags-and-revalidatetag).","optional":false,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[]}]}]},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"text":"Returns","id":"addrules-returns"},{"kind":"typeList","sectionTitle":"addRules","types":[{"name":"Promise","type":"Promise&#60;[AdminPromotionResponse](/references/types/HttpTypes/interfaces/types.HttpTypes.AdminPromotionResponse)&#62;","optional":false,"defaultValue":"","description":"The promotion's details.","expandable":false,"children":[{"name":"promotion","type":"[AdminPromotion](/references/types/HttpTypes/interfaces/types.HttpTypes.AdminPromotion)","description":"The promotion's details.","optional":false,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[{"name":"application_method","type":"[AdminApplicationMethod](/references/types/HttpTypes/interfaces/types.HttpTypes.AdminApplicationMethod)","description":"The promotion's application method.","optional":true,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[]},{"name":"rules","type":"[AdminPromotionRule](/references/types/HttpTypes/interfaces/types.HttpTypes.AdminPromotionRule)[]","description":"The rules for the promotion.","optional":true,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[]},{"name":"id","type":"`string`","description":"","optional":false,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[]},{"name":"code","type":"`string`","description":"","optional":true,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[]},{"name":"type","type":"[PromotionTypeValues](/references/promotion/types/promotion.PromotionTypeValues)","description":"The promotion's possible types.","optional":true,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[]},{"name":"is_automatic","type":"`boolean`","description":"","optional":true,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[]},{"name":"is_tax_inclusive","type":"`boolean`","description":"","optional":true,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[]},{"name":"limit","type":"`null` \\| `number`","description":"","optional":true,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[]},{"name":"used","type":"`number`","description":"","optional":true,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[]},{"name":"status","type":"[PromotionStatusValues](/references/promotion/types/promotion.PromotionStatusValues)","description":"The promotion's possible types.","optional":true,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[]},{"name":"campaign_id","type":"`string`","description":"","optional":true,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[]},{"name":"campaign","type":"[AdminCampaign](/references/types/HttpTypes/interfaces/types.HttpTypes.AdminCampaign)","description":"","optional":true,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[]},{"name":"created_at","type":"`string`","description":"","optional":false,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[]},{"name":"updated_at","type":"`string`","description":"","optional":false,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[]},{"name":"deleted_at","type":"`null` \\| `string`","description":"","optional":false,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[]}]}]}]}]}